        "question_type": "Practical",
        "exam_year": "2021",
        "question_text": "<p>Specimen <strong>H </strong>(Plastic bucket)<br />\r\n<img alt=\"Round bucket plastic household 12 liters\" src=\"https://www.voussert.com/Asset/PHOTOS2000/887110.jpg\" style=\"width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(a)(i) State <strong>five </strong>ways in which specimen&nbsp;<strong>H </strong>could be used in poultry production.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(ii) Mention <strong>two </strong>advantages of using specimen <strong>H </strong>in animal production</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(iii) State <strong>two </strong>disadvantages of using specimen&nbsp;<strong>H </strong>in animal production.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specimen I (Mercury in glass thermometer)</strong><br />\r\n<img alt=\"Different Parts of a Mercury Thermometer\" src=\"https://s3-us-west-1.amazonaws.com/contentlab.studiod/getty/eca544c88fa74c0c937b128667ecc479.jpg\" style=\"height:197px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b) Give one reason for using specimen <strong>I </strong>in the brooding of chicks</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specimen J (Ear tag)</strong><br />\r\n<img alt=\"Livestock Ear Tag (For Cattle, Pigs, and Goats) - Identification Tool -  Afrimash.com - Nigeria\" src=\"https://www.afrimash.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/100PC-Cow-Cattle-TPU-Ear-Tag-Signs-With-Word-Ear-Tags-Typing-Copper-Head-Earrings-Farm-1.jpg\" style=\"height:300px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(c)(i) State <strong>two </strong>ways in which the use of specimen <strong>J </strong>is important in animal production.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(ii) Name <strong>three </strong>farm animals on which specimen <strong>J </strong>could be used.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p><strong>(a)i.&nbsp;Ways which specimen H (Plastic bucket) in poultry production: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Fetching/supply of water -<br />\r\nC onveying/supply of feed.<br />\r\n- Collecting/packing of eggs/conveying of processed products<br />\r\n- Evacuation of litter materials/disposal of waste.<br />\r\n- Storage of feed/water<br />\r\n- Storage of drugs/keeping treatment tools as first aid containers&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Mixing of medications.<br />\r\n- Mixing of feed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(i) Advantages of using specimen H (Plastic bucket) in animal production:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Portable/easy to handle/light in weight.<br />\r\n- Does not rust/corrode -Cheap.<br />\r\n- lt is readily available.<br />\r\n- Cannot be attacked by termite/insects.<br />\r\n- Contents are protected from contamination.<br />\r\n- Does not absorb moisture/keep contents dry.<br />\r\n- Eggs are not easily cracked.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(iii) Disadvantage of using specimen H (Plastic Bucket) in animal production:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Can break/crack.<br />\r\n- Can catch fire.<br />\r\n- Non-biodegradable/contaminate the environment.<br />\r\n- Affected by direct sunlight.<br />\r\n- Absorbs smell and taste of items kept in it/tainting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(b) Uses of the specimen (Mercury in glass thermometer) in brooding of chicks:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>- For checking the temperature in the brooder house</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(c)i.&nbsp;Ways in which specimen J (Ear tag) is important in animal producti0n: </strong><br />\r\n- Cattle.<br />\r\n- Sheep.<br />\r\n- Camel.<br />\r\n- Pig Horse<br />\r\n- Donkey.<br />\r\n- Rabbit.<br />\r\n- Goat.</p>",
