        "question_text": "<p>Specimen K (Head of cock)<br />\r\n<img alt=\"Close Up Head of Ayam Kampong or Ayam Kampung is the Chicken Breed Reported  from Indonesia. `free-range Chicken` or `village Stock Photo - Image of  country, brown: 172049390\" src=\"https://thumbs.dreamstime.com/b/close-up-head-cock-ayam-kampong-ayam-kampung-chicken-breed-reported-indonesia-free-range-chicken-village-172049394.jpg\" style=\"height:450px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(a) Draw and label <strong>five </strong>parts of specimen <strong>K</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b) Mention <strong>one </strong>function of each of the labelled parts of specimen <strong>K</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(c) Mention <strong>two </strong>management practices that could be carried out on specimen <strong>K</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nSpecimen <strong>L </strong>(Pair of scissors)<br />\r\n<img alt=\"Open Pair Of Scissors With Black Handles Isolated On White Background.  Stock Photo, Picture And Royalty Free Image. Image 38286243.\" src=\"https://previews.123rf.com/images/pixelrobot/pixelrobot1504/pixelrobot150401536/38286243-open-pair-of-scissors-with-black-handles-isolated-on-white-background-.jpg\" style=\"height:195px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(d) Name <strong>one </strong>toll which could be used in place of specimen <strong>L </strong>to carry out the management practices on specimen <strong>K</strong>.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p><strong>(a) Drawing and labeling of specimen K(Head of cock):</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"No description available.\" src=\"https://scontent.flos5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.15752-9/258886323_453293939820828_514266915500567632_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-5&amp;_nc_sid=ae9488&amp;_nc_eui2=AeGiSMjv0BnXhnX09MPhENryOrgPGoMPDXg6uA8agw8NeKgEFkEenD5SVyJb2d5-pb8RRg9p_n1j8PtURhh6j8Rs&amp;_nc_ohc=ktapO2kWTfIAX8zMD6h&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.flos5-2.fna&amp;oh=03_AVJcbbwUWm0L6jOmFVaO7xyUYBzBBtsZRHKn1oH2CdKxqw&amp;oe=624BEFCD\" style=\"height:182px; width:250px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Parts to label:-Eye, Feather, Ear, Beak, Earlobe, Comb, Nostril, Wattle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(b) Functions of labeled parts of specimen k (Head of cock): </strong><br />\r\n-&nbsp;Beak<br />\r\n- Picking feed/drinking/scratching/defense/turning egg in incubat1on<br />\r\n- For vision/sight<br />\r\n- For smelling<br />\r\n- For hearing<br />\r\n- Courtship/temperature regulation<br />\r\n- Courtship/ Sex appeal/ temperature regulation Balancing and warming the ear Eye Nostril Ear Wattle Comb Ear lobe Feathers<br />\r\n- Insulation/protection</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(c) Management practices that could be carried out on specimen K(Head of cock) using specimen L (Pair of scissors): </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>-&nbsp;Debeaking.<br />\r\n- Dewattling/dubbing<br />\r\n- Decombing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(d) Tools that could be used in place of specimen L (Pair of scissors) to carry out the management practices on specimen L (Head of cork):<br />\r\n- Sharp knife.<br />\r\n- Sharp blade.<br />\r\n- Scalpel<br />\r\n-&nbsp;Beak trimmer<br />\r\n-&nbsp;Debeaking</p>",
